tags: $:/tags/Global
title: $:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/components/link-items

\whitespace trim

<!-- The Link families of the Fragment root: fragments rendered after a GSD link — the link-target counterpart of the Row placements. Every family is a tag list under $:/tags/hypergsd/Fragment/Link/* (an open set — a family exists the moment a caller hosts it): link-tag names the family, Action by default (the project and contact picks, the pre-requisite rows); the sub-project pick on project panels passes Project. The visibility base derives from the tag ($:/config/hypergsd/Fragment/Link/<family>/visibility/<title>), and type suppression uses the SAME vocabulary as rows, keyed on the link TARGET's hgsd-type (linked-type, derived once per call from the target's own tags through the Type tag list — the row engine's item-type shape; a member hidden for a type renders beside no link to that type; untyped targets match no config and show). Members render with linked-tiddler = the target title and the ambient scope intact; order via each tag tiddler's list field. A member adorning several families ships as one member tiddler per family, so the Fragments tab's placement select stays single-valued. The span is the centring container (stylesheet .hgsd-link-items). Members transclude INLINE: block mode wraps a member's widget line in a <p>, and a gated-off member leaves that empty paragraph behind, defeating the container's :empty margin collapse. -->
\procedure hgsd-link-items(linked-tiddler, link-tag:"$:/tags/hypergsd/Fragment/Link/Action")
<%if [<linked-tiddler>!match[]] %>
<$let visibility-base={{{ [<link-tag>removeprefix[$:/tags/hypergsd/]addprefix[$:/config/hypergsd/]addsuffix[/visibility/]] }}}
  linked-type={{{ [<linked-tiddler>tags[]] :filter[tag[$:/tags/hypergsd/Type]] :and[get[hgsd-type]] }}}>
<span class="hgsd-link-items">
<$list filter="[<link-tag>] :and[tagging[]]" variable="link-item">
  <%if [<visibility-base>addsuffix<link-item>get[text]else[show]match[show]] %>
    <%if [[$:/config/hypergsd/Fragment/type-hide/]addsuffix<link-item>addsuffix[/]addsuffix<linked-type>get[text]else[show]match[hide]] %>
      <!-- suppressed for this link-target type -->
    <%else%>
      <$transclude $tiddler=<<link-item>> $mode="inline"/>
    <%endif%>
  <%endif%>
</$list>
</span>
</$let>
<%endif%>
\end
